'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 4''' was the fourth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 11, 2026 at the Tokuyama Municipal Gymnasium in [[Tokuyama]] — the second and final tournament night in the city. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 2 matches.

The night is remembered for the first blemish on [[Jusuf Muntasir]]'s NOPW record: [[Takagi Yuto]] — the Dragon — defeated the IC Champion with the Dragon lariat at 16:41, becoming the first man to make Jusuf bump. The match was the night's main event and its story: Jusuf's refusal to sell met an opponent whose strikes were too real to no-sell.

The show also featured [[Tadayoshi Ishida]]'s emotional rebound — the veteran submitted [[Mamadou Diallo|Mamadou "The Hammer" Diallo]] with the Ishida Lock, his first points of the tournament after the 8:56 humiliation at [[G1 Climax 2026 Day 2|Day 2]] — and [[KAZUKI (wrestler)|KAZUKI]]'s survival of the young lion [[Yuto Ono]]'s flash cradle in the semi-main.

